  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘、この前の映画\r\n追加の舞台挨拶が決まりそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "映画の動員数がなかなか良いみたいでさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019110010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふぇ～～！\r\nそいは嬉しか～！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040040090",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200401911/2004019110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘、すごく頑張ってたから\r\n結果がついてきて当たり前なんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019110020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ううん～\r\n演技のうまくできたとはみんなのおかげばい～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401911/2004019110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019110030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "監督に、スタッフさんに共演者のみんなに……\r\nもちろんプロデューサーも！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401911/2004019110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……\r\n俺は恋鐘の頑張りのおかげだと思うんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、ありがとう\r\n俺も少しでも力になれていたら嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういえば、恋鐘が雪を眺めるシーンは\r\n特に評判が良かったそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あのシーンの撮影中、\r\n何か考えてたことはあるのか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019110040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふぇ……\r\nそ、そいは～……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401911/2004019110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、すまん……！\r\n言いたくなかったら大丈夫だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019110050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……えっと……\r\nそ、そがんわけじゃなかけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401911/2004019110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019110060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……う、うちが\r\n考えとったとは…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401911/2004019110060"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019110070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……～～っ\r\nも、もうこん話はおしまいばい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0327",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401911/2004019110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019110080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "グルメロケのゲストの話ばせんと……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401911/2004019110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、悪い\r\nそうだよな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "先方からは、恋鐘に縁がある人に声をかけたいから\r\n候補者を教えてほしいって言われてるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019110090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ん～……\r\nそいやったら、アンティーカのメンバーでもよかけど──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401911/2004019110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019110100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "せっかくやし、今まで一緒にロケばしたことのなか人が\r\nおればよかとけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401911/2004019110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなると、最近知り合った人とかがいいかなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019110110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……！\r\nそいやったら──",
